          "author": "sidharthv96",
          "body": "There is still an issue here, but pretty sure it was already present. So this can be fixed in a separate PR if required.\r\n\r\n- User passes mainBranchName in config in initialize, it will be set in line 49.\r\n- If the user changes that later, or passes a different value in yaml, it won't change what's there in 49. \r\n\r\nI'd suggest moving all three of these into the imperative state, so they'll be reset after each diagram. \r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73c8155c-7da0-4a11-854b-fdc508bee95c)\r\n",
